Z||000042||Monkeyman||09-10-2000||01:07 AM||||Saw my 1st Fiero at the Detroit Auto Show in...must have been '83?  I didn't stop drooling for days.  Unfortunately, I was just a young punk kid of 15.  No money, no permission, no license, no way.  Bummer.  I looked at them after I graduated from HS, but never had the money when I had the opportunity to buy one.  My wife finally bought me my 1st one (the Monkeymobile--sniff, sniff) last October and I got my current driver (the Grape Ape) in February.  I'm 32 (I think--might be 33) so I fit into the "right" category for whatever that's worth.||||reg||1
